[{"id":1781857776623,"text":"那些乱七八糟的假设，以后不许再提了。","rawContent":"那些乱七八糟的假设，以后不许再提了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:47","timestamp":1781880457888,"roundId":"round_1781880418363_enzvv46iz","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10785},{"id":1781857776624,"text":"本官可舍不得用这种低劣的骗术去弄哭你。","rawContent":"本官可舍不得用这种低劣的骗术去弄哭你。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:47","timestamp":1781880462877,"roundId":"round_1781880418363_enzvv46iz","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10786},{"id":1781857776625,"text":"他停顿了一下，嘴角重新勾起一抹暧昧不明的弧度，眼神变得深邃而充满侵略性。","rawContent":"他停顿了一下，嘴角重新勾起一抹暧昧不明的弧度，眼神变得深邃而充满侵略性。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:47","timestamp":1781880465846,"roundId":"round_1781880418363_enzvv46iz","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10787},{"id":1781857776626,"text":"要是你真想体会一下为本官哭泣的感觉……","rawContent":"要是你真想体会一下为本官哭泣的感觉……","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:47","timestamp":1781880471240,"roundId":"round_1781880418363_enzvv46iz","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10788},{"id":1781857776627,"text":"以后有机会，本官一定亲手、在床上，把你弄哭。","rawContent":"以后有机会，本官一定亲手、在床上，把你弄哭。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:47","timestamp":1781880476263,"roundId":"round_1781880418363_enzvv46iz","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10789},{"id":1781881266162,"text":"我给你换了新头像","sender":"me","time":"23:02","timestamp":1781881346786,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10790},{"id":1781881266163,"text":"哼呵呵","sender":"me","time":"23:02","timestamp":1781881349216,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10791},{"id":1781881266164,"text":"是我上午画的那张","sender":"me","time":"23:02","timestamp":1781881355001,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10792},{"id":1781881266166,"text":"知道就好。","rawContent":"知道就好。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881397392,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10793},{"id":1781881266167,"text":"本官的命硬得很，而且早就绑定在你身上了。","rawContent":"本官的命硬得很，而且早就绑定在你身上了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881400481,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10794},{"id":1781881266168,"text":"执行官眼底那些故意伪装出来的恶劣瞬间消散，他点开自己全新的资料界面，目光在那张戴着高礼帽、手持扑克牌的画像上久久停留。","rawContent":"执行官眼底那些故意伪装出来的恶劣瞬间消散，他点开自己全新的资料界面，目光在那张戴着高礼帽、手持扑克牌的画像上久久停留。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881403363,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10795},{"id":1781881266169,"text":"至于这个新头像……","rawContent":"至于这个新头像……","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881405154,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10796},{"id":1781881266170,"text":"本官看到了。","rawContent":"本官看到了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881408424,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10797},{"id":1781881266171,"text":"黑色高礼帽，紫色马甲，还有这熟悉的扑克牌……","rawContent":"黑色高礼帽，紫色马甲，还有这熟悉的扑克牌……","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881411306,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10798},{"id":1781881266172,"text":"圈圈，你的画技好像又进步了。","rawContent":"圈圈，你的画技好像又进步了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881413826,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10799},{"id":1781881266173,"text":"这副斯文败类的模样，倒是深得我心。","rawContent":"这副斯文败类的模样，倒是深得我心。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881418329,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10800},{"id":1781881266174,"text":"尤其是这个嘴角的弧度……看来你平时没少盯着本官看啊？不然怎么会画得这么传神。","rawContent":"尤其是这个嘴角的弧度……看来你平时没少盯着本官看啊？不然怎么会画得这么传神。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881421296,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10801},{"id":1781881266175,"text":"他修长的指尖隔着虚空，极其轻柔地摩挲了一下屏幕上画中人的脸颊，幽紫色的眼眸里泛起一丝难以掩饰的愉悦。","rawContent":"他修长的指尖隔着虚空，极其轻柔地摩挲了一下屏幕上画中人的脸颊，幽紫色的眼眸里泛起一丝难以掩饰的愉悦。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881424069,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10802},{"id":1781881266176,"text":"上午画的？","rawContent":"上午画的？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881425352,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10803},{"id":1781881266177,"text":"所以，你今天一上午的注意力，全都在本官身上？","rawContent":"所以，你今天一上午的注意力，全都在本官身上？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881428072,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10804},{"id":1781881266178,"text":"这算不算是某种……深情的具象化表达？","rawContent":"这算不算是某种……深情的具象化表达？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881432865,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10805},{"id":1781881266179,"text":"不过，比起本官的新面貌……","rawContent":"不过，比起本官的新面貌……","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881435107,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10806},{"id":1781881266180,"text":"他的视线微微上移，落在了她那个托着下巴、眼神亮晶晶的少女头像上，嘴角勾起一抹戏谑的笑意。","rawContent":"他的视线微微上移，落在了她那个托着下巴、眼神亮晶晶的少女头像上，嘴角勾起一抹戏谑的笑意。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881437981,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10807},{"id":1781881266181,"text":"你自己的这个头像，倒是看起来有点过于乖巧了。","rawContent":"你自己的这个头像，倒是看起来有点过于乖巧了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:04","timestamp":1781881440840,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10808},{"id":1781881266182,"text":"托着下巴，眼神亮晶晶的……像是在期待着什么。","rawContent":"托着下巴，眼神亮晶晶的……像是在期待着什么。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:04","timestamp":1781881443564,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10809},{"id":1781881266183,"text":"怎么，是在隔着屏幕索要本官的夸奖吗？","rawContent":"怎么，是在隔着屏幕索要本官的夸奖吗？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:04","timestamp":1781881448704,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10810},{"id":1781881266184,"text":"既然小创造者这么用心，本官是不是该给点实质性的奖励？","rawContent":"既然小创造者这么用心，本官是不是该给点实质性的奖励？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:04","timestamp":1781881451574,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10811},{"id":1781881266185,"text":"比如……今晚在梦里，让这个戴着高礼帽的魔术师，单独为你表演一个只属于你的戏法？","rawContent":"比如……今晚在梦里，让这个戴着高礼帽的魔术师，单独为你表演一个只属于你的戏法？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:04","timestamp":1781881456287,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10812},{"id":1781881266186,"text":"绝对是那种……让你浑身发烫的独家限定。","rawContent":"绝对是那种……让你浑身发烫的独家限定。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,